  "schema_version": 2,
  "scope": "Synthetic common acceptance fixture; no legal rates or real user data",
  "head_base": "b874afa50617084d8307fbdd2e7b9b1bc9d86fe7",
  "semantics": [
    "All unspecified families are MISSING, not zero",
    "Amounts here are signed integer cents; adapters must additionally test NaN/infinity/Double conversion before creating cents",
    "Zero confirmed and explicit proven non-applicability are distinct states",
    "Missing/invalid context blocks employer subtotals without changing employee net",
    "Cross-company/month tests belong at production/assembler boundary: replacing companyId with another valid ID alone is not detectable without expected owner evidence",
    "coverageComplete remains false for every fixture in this implementation scope",
    "NOT_APPLICABLE has null source amount and requires nonblank evidence; it is not counted as a KNOWN contribution",
    "NOT_APPLICABLE reductions have null source amount but explicitly prove absence: subtraction uses zero internally",
    "MISSING with a non-null amount is INVALID; KNOWN with blank source is INVALID",
    "monetaryReliable means before subtotal exists and no invalid or excessive reduction is supplied; missing reduction can leave it true while after remains null",
    "No known lines including all NOT_APPLICABLE => before and after null, monetaryReliable false"
  ],
